{"2074620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ars Notoria", "steam_appid": 2074620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/extras/44ba82b004d682c637bd5e3f353ebdf3.avif?t=1764313224\" width=1500 height=3420 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ars Notoria is an <strong>open-world survival crafting game</strong> set in a rich fantasy world. Blending classic gameplay elements like <strong>building</strong>,<strong> crafting</strong>, and <strong>survival</strong>, it invites you on a journey filled with wonder, mystery, and discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture out alone or team up with friends to explore a land full of secrets and danger. Build your base, gather resources, expand your influence, and stand against the ever-shifting threat of the Enthralled. Whether you prefer to go solo or fight alongside allies, the game delivers a complete and rewarding experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Vast World, Survival Evolved</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a dangerous open world filled with forests, fields, dungeons, and more, where breathtaking landscapes shaped by magic await discovery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into shadowy depths and frozen caverns, traverse ancient magical ruins and the hidden lairs of bandits, confronting a wide variety of Enthralled along the way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face intense boss fights against colossal, corrupted creatures that threaten to bring ruin to the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/extras/3c517e0a73cb9033320f9dd2ba12aee0.poster.avif?t=1764313224\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/extras/3c517e0a73cb9033320f9dd2ba12aee0.webm?t=1764313224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/extras/3c517e0a73cb9033320f9dd2ba12aee0.mp4?t=1764313224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master Magic, Lead Your Squad</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn six distinct schools of magic: Fire, Frost, Poison, Lightning, Chaos, and Holy. Each brings unique spells and playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine magical sigils and traits to craft spells that suit your fighting style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imbue your gear with magic and elemental powers to enhance your effectiveness in battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a team of adventurers with varied fighting styles, weapons, and roles. Switch between them during battle for fluid, tactical combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/extras/628938aadc682315603f637a5708114a.poster.avif?t=1764313224\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/extras/628938aadc682315603f637a5708114a.webm?t=1764313224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/extras/628938aadc682315603f637a5708114a.mp4?t=1764313224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join Factions, Grow Your Influence</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Align yourself with various factions and rise through their ranks to expand your influence across the kingdom.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign faction members to handle essential tasks like gathering resources, guarding outposts, crafting equipment, or researching new technologies.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each faction offers unique questlines and branching narratives, with your choices shaping the future of the kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/extras/f2a2fc2e469bee228f4c91a65f9a08f5.poster.avif?t=1764313224\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/extras/f2a2fc2e469bee228f4c91a65f9a08f5.webm?t=1764313224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/extras/f2a2fc2e469bee228f4c91a65f9a08f5.mp4?t=1764313224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Gather, Build, and Prosper</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and upgrade your base using a wide range of structures and materials. Customize patterns and colors to create your ideal refuge, fortress, or outpost.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streamline routine tasks with automated systems that help your settlement grow while you focus on exploration and combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use global resource storage to keep materials without overloading your inventory, and access what you need anytime, anywhere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tame wild creatures or summon arcane companions using magic or skill, and gain allies that aid you in harvesting, defense, or battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/extras/c5892343affe8c2063e720b484a8e5e4.poster.avif?t=1764313224\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/extras/c5892343affe8c2063e720b484a8e5e4.webm?t=1764313224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/extras/c5892343affe8c2063e720b484a8e5e4.mp4?t=1764313224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Adventure Together, Fight Side by Side</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In online co-op mode, team up with friends to explore the world of Ars Notoria.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share the journey as you experience story quests, conquer dungeons, build a dream base, and shape your own epic tale together.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ars Notoria is an <strong>open-world survival crafting game</strong> set in a rich fantasy world. Blending classic gameplay elements like <strong>building</strong>,<strong> crafting</strong>, and <strong>survival</strong>, it invites you on a journey filled with wonder, mystery, and discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture out alone or team up with friends to explore a land full of secrets and danger. Build your base, gather resources, expand your influence, and stand against the ever-shifting threat of the Enthralled. Whether you prefer to go solo or fight alongside allies, the game delivers a complete and rewarding experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Vast World, Survival Evolved</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a dangerous open world filled with forests, fields, dungeons, and more, where breathtaking landscapes shaped by magic await discovery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into shadowy depths and frozen caverns, traverse ancient magical ruins and the hidden lairs of bandits, confronting a wide variety of Enthralled along the way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face intense boss fights against colossal, corrupted creatures that threaten to bring ruin to the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/extras/3c517e0a73cb9033320f9dd2ba12aee0.poster.avif?t=1764313224\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/extras/3c517e0a73cb9033320f9dd2ba12aee0.webm?t=1764313224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/extras/3c517e0a73cb9033320f9dd2ba12aee0.mp4?t=1764313224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master Magic, Lead Your Squad</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn six distinct schools of magic: Fire, Frost, Poison, Lightning, Chaos, and Holy. Each brings unique spells and playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine magical sigils and traits to craft spells that suit your fighting style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imbue your gear with magic and elemental powers to enhance your effectiveness in battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a team of adventurers with varied fighting styles, weapons, and roles. Switch between them during battle for fluid, tactical combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/extras/628938aadc682315603f637a5708114a.poster.avif?t=1764313224\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/extras/628938aadc682315603f637a5708114a.webm?t=1764313224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"ht