inventory, and access what you need anytime, anywhere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tame wild creatures or summon arcane companions using magic or skill, and gain allies that aid you in harvesting, defense, or battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/extras/c5892343affe8c2063e720b484a8e5e4.poster.avif?t=1764313224\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/extras/c5892343affe8c2063e720b484a8e5e4.webm?t=1764313224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/extras/c5892343affe8c2063e720b484a8e5e4.mp4?t=1764313224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Adventure Together, Fight Side by Side</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In online co-op mode, team up with friends to explore the world of Ars Notoria.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share the journey as you experience story quests, conquer dungeons, build a dream base, and shape your own epic tale together.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Ars Notoria is an open-world survival crafting game set in a rich fantasy world. Learn six distinct schools of magic, gather resources, build your base, expand your influence, and stand against the ever-shifting threat of the Enthralled. You are the one destined to change the kingdom.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Spanish - Spain<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2074620/f088bf86d6b224b853cb05acd5de226cfd4387a5/header.jpg?t=1764313224", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app